# Build context exclusions — keep the context small and free of secrets.
# Dockerfiles reinstall deps and rebuild from source, so none of the below
# are needed in the build context (and several are huge or sensitive).

# Dependencies (deps stage runs `pnpm install`)
**/node_modules

# Local git worktrees — ~24GB of node_modules/builds, the #1 context bloat
.worktrees
.git

# Build outputs (regenerated by the build stage)
**/dist
**/.next
**/*.tsbuildinfo
**/coverage
e2e/playwright-report
e2e/test-results
e2e/.auth

# Secrets & local env (build uses build-args / runtime env, never .env files)
**/.env
**/.env.local
**/.env.*.local

# Agent / dev scratch and local artifacts not needed to build the app
agents
memory
.claude
.playwright-mcp
*.tmp
.~lock.*
*.pdf
*.pptx
*.xlsx
brevo-analysis.html

# Editor / OS
.vscode
.idea
.DS_Store
